WEBVTT

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.100
What's going on?

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.710
Is something about to start?

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.860
Mega-nii!

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.610
Taada!

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.620
The Dream Theatre is ready!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.750
And to commemorate this event,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.350
an unveiling concert will be held!

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.970
Awesome!

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.760
So they finally finished it?

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.140
Have you all formed your five person teams?

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.220
Eh?!

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.280
Nope.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.750
Not yet!

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.890
What's this? How unfortunate...

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:45.540
Then how about this...

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:49.630
The team that wins tomorrow's sports festival
will get to put on a special concert.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:52.190
The team that wins tomorrow's sports festival?

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.780
We're having a sports festival?

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.980
Can we have as many people as we want-chanko?

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.200
Yes.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:04.540
However, the condition is that you show me your glittering sweat.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.670
We'd love to participate!

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.490
Chanko!

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:08.540
Kyupikon!

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.720
I'm glad.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.120
Now then, let us meet again tomorrow.

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.450
It'd be nice if we could participate.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.000
Huh? We're not?

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.830
Are you dense or something, Lala?

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:23.820
We haven't reformed yet.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:24.440
Uh...

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:29.290
Even if we entered the sports festival and managed to win...

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.260
...we won't be able to perform as a team.

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:32.500
Pushuu~.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.870
Everything's those stuffed animal's fault.

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:36.070
Yeah.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:38.750
Let's do the sports festival.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:39.570
Huh?

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.100
But...

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.880
I have an idea.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.580
What is it? What 'cha got?! Out with it!

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:46.450
What do you have in mind-pri?

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:21.250
First to the Dream Theatre-kuma!

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:23.930
Kuma!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.070
Let's make a bet-pri!

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:27.470
Kuma?!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:31.060
If we manage to win the sports festival,

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.430
you'll bare witness to our ritual-pri.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.820
SoLaMi Smile will reform-pri!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:37.450
What?!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.030
You're asking too much!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.240
I'll be cursed if I do that!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.950
Like I told you, it's not happening!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.500
Don't enter the sports festival!

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:48.450
If by chance you girls win...

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.330
Then be cursed-pri.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.330
No, not that!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:55.030
Besides, curses don't exist-pri.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:58.710
We're doing everything we can for our team.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.010
You're also part of our team, Kuma-san.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:03.090
Ah! Hold on a moment-kuma!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.840
Hold on-usa!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.100
As if!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.420
Better prepare yourself for the worst.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.300
But...

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.100
Hold on-kuma!

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.860
Watch where you're flying-usa!

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.610
So you're in this situation, too-kuma?

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.240
You too-usa?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.600
<i>Though, there's nothing to worry about-usa.</i>

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.600
<i>They won't win that easily-usa.</i>

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.950
<i>I'll be fine-kuma.</i>

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.460
<i>They've got Sophie on their team-kuma.</i>

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.060
What the hell-kuma?!

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.490
I'm a manager, you know-kuma!

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:33.880
What should I do-usa?!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:34.970
That's enough, you idiot!

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.880
It's heart-breaking-usa!

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.370
Neko~n.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.600
It's finally starting!

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.370
The sports festival will be starting shortly.

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.930
All those participating, please gather up.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.200
Okay!

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.860
We're already in line.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.360
Okay~.
Capisce!
Pri!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.860
Relax.
Max!
Go!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.090
The prophecy has changed since last week.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:08.980
Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 13, section 32:

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:14.870
"Those who have been defeated when the angel descends shall weep in frustration."

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:17.380
Leave the sports festival to me-nano!

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:24.010
I shall have Manaka Lala bow down to us when we win!

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:31.180
Welcome to the "All Idol Grand Sports Festival",
where all of our idols are trying to win the prestigious...

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.120
...Dream Theatre Special Unveiling Concert!

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.750
There truly are a lot of idol teams participating.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.370
If you were to walk your dog, he'd likely bump into an idol.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:41.840
W-Woof!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:42.590
Huh?

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.460
Anyway, aim to be number one,

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:50.030
and claim the right to have a truly once in a lifetime unveiling concert!

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:53.680
Our first event is an obstacle competition.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:57.540
Please choose one member from your team to compete.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.090
That'll be me.

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:02.470
I've been practising my swinging, so I've got this.

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:05.540
And I've been doing ninja training every day.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.710
Right, Leona?

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:07.440
Yeah.

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.140
While in the bath.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.010
That'll be a problem.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:11.510
Why?!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.120
I'll do it.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:12.360
Presentation is what's important, you know!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:14.520
Let's leave this one to Lala-pri.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.020
I like races, so caprace!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.140
Start!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:23.130
How cheap, Dorthy!

00:06:23.130 --> 00:06:24.150
Dorthy!

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.400
If I win, you won't have a problem with it, right?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:30.470
Teams who haven't started are disqualified.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.330
Kyupikon!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.540
Those who go off the path are also disqualified.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:40.840
Capisce!

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:41.670
Chanko!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:46.920
We who have been reborn from the ancient darkness...

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:50.590
...entrust that thee shall bring us victory, Mikan!

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:54.560
Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:56.470
Leave it to me-nano!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:57.930
I'm off!

00:06:58.470 --> 00:06:59.720
Oh, box vaulting!

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:00.940
My speciality-chanko!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.770
Capisce!

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.650
Gel!

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.150
What?!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.760
Gel!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:17.120
That's amazing, Mikan-chan.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:20.710
Gel!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:21.600
Eh?!
Gel!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.500
Mikan is super nimble-pri.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.170
She's in shape.

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.170
Gel-gel!

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.160
I don't know what to say.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.270
Even though Mikan-chan had a late start,

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:37.180
she passed everyone and has taken the lead by showing off her extraordinary reflexes.

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.540
She's amazing!

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:40.050
No way...

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.560
Your next obstacle is an eating contest.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.820
I'm glad I skipped out on breakfast!

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:53.570
Man, there's onions and shichimi in this.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:56.580
Chanko!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.080
I'm so glad there's so much!

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.460
What a heated battle!

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.330
It feels great when you can eat all you want.

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:08.590
Chanko.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.590
Gelruru!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:14.920
Even though she only needed one,
Mikan-chan managed to stack up three huge piles!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:15.590
And now...

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.100
First place!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:25.050
No mortal can beat Mikan when it comes to eating or sports.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.410
Alomagedon shall be victorious.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:30.200
It would be best if you realise how truly fearsome we are.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.790
My, you sure are full of yourself.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.990
Mikan-chan, that was impressive!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.710
Thanks-nano.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.240
I shall bless you too-nano.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.890
With the way things are going, SoLaMi Smile will lose,

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:44.490
which means I don't need to worry about being cursed.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.000
Same here.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.720
Well of course.

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:51.140
Alomagedon has a huge lead.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.440
Our second event is...

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:56.440
...a limbo competition!

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:59.890
After running, jumping, and eating comes passing under, right?

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:03.390
The top four teams will battle it out.

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.250
Huh?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.380
This is a sports festival?

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:09.420
They're going all out.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:11.400
There are only four teams left.

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:14.030
First up, Shion. I got this!

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.910
Let me go!

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.290
Let's Go!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.590
Shion-chan is the first to clear it!

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:26.420
You're up next, Mikan-chan!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.170
Gel!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:32.000
Gelruru!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:34.300
Gel.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.800
A perfect 10-gel!

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:41.230
My dear, have you by chance confused this with the high jump, Mikan-chan?

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.010
Huh?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.450
Unfortunately you've been disqualified.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.060
Eh?!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:48.180
Our next contestant is...

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:51.540
Another disqualification.

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:52.760
Sadako!

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:53.940
Chanko!

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.410
Pushuu~.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:59.450
Sophie-chan shows off her splendid flexibility earning her an impressive score.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:05.820
As it currently stands, the teams with the most points and tied for first are Alomagedon and SoLaMi Smile.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.250
Dressing Parfait comes in third,

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.960
and unfortunately, Team Sadako has been eliminated.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.500
Hooray!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.310
We have one event left in the competition.

00:10:17.310 --> 00:10:19.760
But before that, we'll take a commercial break.

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.640
Our final event is the three-legged race,

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.360
or for some, the four-legged race up the mountain.

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:34.700
They're going all out-pri.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:36.360
Mountain climbing, huh?

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:38.590
This requires teamwork.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:42.000
In other words, it's a competition that will test the strength of one's friendship.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.370
That's right.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.950
And the team that wins...

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.870
...will be given 10,000 points!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:48.940
Gel?!

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:52.380
If we lose, we'll suddenly drop from the top-nano?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.360
What?

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.300
That's sneaky!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.210
That coming from a demon-pri?

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:58.740
This is common in PriPara-pri.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.450
We shall not lose to the likes of ye!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:05.170
After all, the black flames of hell shall wrap themselves around ye.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:05.890
Gel!

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.410
Huh?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.320
Eh?

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:10.770
Something smells fishy-pri.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:14.520
Saury...

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.850
Bonfires aren't allowed here.

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:17.780
Nekon...

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:20.530
Those who have inhaled this smoke shall fall to my magic.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:22.620
Therefore, you shall all lose!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:25.180
Unfortunately for you, I held my breath.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.540
No one would actually inhale in the smoke, would they?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.490
Of course not-pri.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:31.280
I inhaled it!

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:32.290
Huh?!

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:35.170
Now you're cursed!

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:37.170
Start!

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:41.700
Sorry.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.430
The smoke upset my stomach.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:46.430
Let's synchronise on white, black, white!

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.680
White, black.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.580
Faster, Aloma-nano.

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.140
Go on without me, Mikan.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:55.190
No way. We're doing it together-nano.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.920
White, black.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:57.830
Gel! Gel! Gel!

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:58.940
White, black.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.980
Lala, you all right-pri?

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.880
What do we do?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.850
We're in dead last.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.030
Take a deep breath.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.080
A complete capisce!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:12.620
You can do it!

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.100
All right, let's turn this around-pri!

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.600
Go for it!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:15.330
All right, let's turn this around-pri!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.090
Pri! Pri!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:20.890
Capisce!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:21.770
Pushuu~.

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:22.660
Pri! Pri!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:23.610
Capisce!

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:25.340
Pushuu~.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.640
We're pushing so no pushuu~ing!!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.850
Capisce!
Pushuu~.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.250
Pri! Pri!

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.210
Capisce!

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:32.060
Pri! Pri!

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.120
Capisce!

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:34.990
Nice rhythm.
Nice rhythm-pri

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:40.070
There's no way SoLaMi Smile will win-nekon.

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:43.940
Or so I thought! They're gaining-nekon!

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.820
How annoying-nekon!

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:47.620
I guess I'll have to...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:48.590
Pri! Pri!

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.600
Capisce!

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:50.620
Pri! Pri!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:51.910
Hey, Kuma-chan.
Capisce!

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:55.260
Oh, Neko-neesan.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.460
I don't want you to go bald.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.720
So stop those girls right away-nekon.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:04.130
Pre-tty pl-ease.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.630
Capikuma!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:07.240
Capisce!

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:09.340
Hold on! The curse! Don't forget the curse!

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:10.390
Kuma-san?

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.390
Pushuu~.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.550
Sophie!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.790
I fear she's reached her limit-pri.

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:17.400
Pull yourself together, Sophie.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:18.900
S-Sophie...

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:22.160
Sophie, go ahead and use us for support.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:23.150
But...

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.900
That's how teams win-pri!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:26.660
Yeah.

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:29.410
You share your problems with everyone.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.970
And with that, you become one in both body and soul-pri.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:32.910
Okay!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.040
Pri! Pri!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.070
Capisce!

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:37.050
Pri! Pri!

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.130
Capisce!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.000
Pri! Pri!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:39.990
Capisce!

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:40.990
Pri! Pri!

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:41.420
Capi-

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.510
Aloma, are you okay-nano?

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:47.430
Devi...

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.900
That's it.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:51.990
Demons aren't used to running-devi.

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:54.130
This is our chance!

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:55.490
Aloma crashed and burned.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:58.440
But Dressing Parfait are so far ahead.

